cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SDG 4 Data Revision Tracker"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhou
    given-names: Ziyi
abstract: >-
  A typed, tested Python pipeline that treats each release of an SDG 4 education
  database as a data vintage and measures what changes between releases:
  reporting lag, backfill, withdrawals and value revisions. Validated against a
  deterministic synthetic generator with a planted ground truth.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/EllenSyuu/SDG"
keywords:
  - SDG 4
  - official statistics
  - data vintages
  - data revisions
  - data quality
